{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>Thus the children of Israel did all the service.</b> It should have said 'all the work' (את כל המלאכה), but Scripture called the work of the Tabernacle 'service' (עבודה), because they did it for the service of the Holy One, blessed be He, in the manner of what is written (Exodus 23:25): ״ועבדתם את ה׳ אלהיכם״, and it is written (Deuteronomy 13): ״ואותו תעבודו״."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {0 "Citation 'דברים י״ג' left unexpanded as written; the quoted phrase ואותו תעבודו appears at Deuteronomy 13:5 in some editions."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:07:55.882335406Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}